WEBVTT

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:24.000
I've grown used to this body.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.950
And today...

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:28.200
I will disband HXEROS!

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.790
Welcome home!

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.290
Oh, Chacha. We're back.

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:45.910
What happened to your hair?

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:48.580
You two are such adults,
coming home in the morning!

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:51.790
In the morning?

00:00:51.790 --> 00:00:53.750
It's not that late.

00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:57.580
Tonight we're all going to Anno's place.

00:00:57.580 --> 00:00:59.330
Is something up?

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:01.120
That's a secret!

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:04.870
Come to think of it,
my uncle didn't answer his phone.

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:07.250
Do you know anything about it?

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:11.620
I don't know anything
after Himeme and the others picked me up.

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:13.120
Oh.

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:16.580
Well, let's try calling him again
before we set out.

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:17.830
Yeah.

00:02:49.950 --> 00:02:52.410
Super HXEROS!

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:56.000
Episode 11: Bye-bye, HXEROS!

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:11.700
You weren't much of a challenge.

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:16.620
Are you okay?

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:18.790
Yeah, I was just finishing up.

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:22.080
Retto! Get away from her!

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:31.700
Too bad. You let your guard down, human.

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:36.370
What was that?

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:39.500
Retto, do you feel all right?

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:42.250
It was just a prick.
I don't really feel anything.

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:45.080
What was that Kiseichuu's ability?

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:47.200
I-It was...

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.620
Huh?

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:53.950
I've got a weird feeling below the belt.

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:04.120
That Kiseichuu was Nyotaikachuu.

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:08.040
The manhood of a male she stings
becomes disconnected from the body,

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:10.000
which becomes more and more female!

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.580
Th-Then the weasel-like thing
that just ran away is...

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:15.870
The root of your manhood.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:22.290
It's really gone!
The root of my manhood!

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:24.040
Incidentally,
if you don't catch it quickly

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:28.040
and put it back in its original place,
you'll never be able to put it back.

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:30.450
Seriously?

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:38.410
Once I become the governor, I'll live up
to my pledges to reform the laws,

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:40.950
cut back on unnecessary spending,

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:43.120
and strive to establish
a wholesome society.

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:47.040
I thought it ran this way.

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:49.120
Thank you!

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:53.540
What's wrong, Chacha?

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:55.080
Nothing.

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:58.040
Anyway, where did it go?

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:00.870
Over this way!

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:02.160
All right!

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:11.750
I finally managed to capture it.

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:13.750
What are you just sitting there for?

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:17.040
If you don't hurry, it may be too late!

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:18.580
But how?

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.620
Put it against its former place.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:30.870
Is this my body?

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:35.080
Certainly I'm feeling
more and more like a girl.

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:37.370
Then I'll help you.

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:38.750
I don't need help!

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:43.540
I'm home.

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:48.750
Damn it! Get back here!

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:54.540
Where did my manhood go?

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:58.330
It's not what you're thinking!
This is, um...

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:01.540
Uh, may I have your name?

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:06.330
Don't tell me
Shirayuki doesn't even recognize me?

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:10.700
Um, I'm Hiiro, Retto's little sister.

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:14.040
I came to see my brother.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:18.330
I see. Please come in.
I'll get you some tea.

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:19.660
Th-Thank you.

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:24.620
What's wrong, Hiiro?
Your face is flushed.

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:27.120
This sensation, is it...

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:31.120
I-I have to go to the restroom!

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:34.250
Come on, Runba. Sit still.

00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:38.660
Watch closely, Kirara.
This is how you wash Runba.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:40.790
Isn't that too sudsy?

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:45.500
Runba gets dirty easily,
so this is perfect.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.450
Right, Runba?

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:49.450
Who?

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:51.620
Who is that?

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:57.750
This lukewarm feeling.
I'm starting to get a bad premonition.

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:02.750
Um, who are you?

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:08.000
She's Enjo's sister, Hiiro,
and that's her pet.

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:09.580
Hiiro?

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:12.790
You've gotten a lot bigger
since the last time I saw you.

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:15.330
R-Really?

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:19.120
Crap! Hoshino knows my sister.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:26.290
That's dangerous, Runba!

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:32.330
Ow.

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:35.410
Why do you have to be so clumsy, Kirara?

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:37.950
If you want to blame someone,
blame Runba!

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:42.040
Since I'm already soaked,
maybe I'll just take a bath.

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:43.120
Good idea.

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:45.870
Why don't you take a bath with us,
"little sister"?

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:46.870
Your clothes are wet.

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:48.750
No, that's okay!

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:52.120
Come on. Don't be shy!

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:56.000
Besides, I wanna ask her
about Retto's weakness!

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:02.580
M-Momozono is stronger than she looks!

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:05.250
Hiiro, how old are you again?

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:07.410
F-Fifteen.

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:09.950
Huh, the same age as Sora.

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:13.500
But I didn't know Retto
had a little sister.

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:17.250
We all used to play together
a long time ago.

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:20.580
So is there anyone you like, Hiiro?

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.410
Nope, nobody!

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:27.120
I'm suspicious. And jealous of these boobs
that are bigger than mine!

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:33.330
I wonder if your big brother
is in love with someone.

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:35.700
I-I'm just asking out of idle curiosity!

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:39.410
Momoka said she wanted to ask
about his weakness, so it just came out!

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:40.620
Huh.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:45.750
I don't really know what he thinks...

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:48.370
...but one thing I can say...

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:51.450
...is that on the inside,
he's an elementary school student.

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:54.410
His feelings haven't changed.

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:59.370
That's a pretty sassy observation
for a little sister!

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:05.290
--What's that weasel doing?
--I don't know.

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:07.540
It probably wants to be washed, too.

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:10.500
All right, fine.
I'll make it nice and clean.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:12.290
Th-That's...

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:15.910
Here you go. You like it here?

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:20.040
It looks so comfortable.

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:22.750
It's like they're washing...

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:25.790
...the source of my manhood!

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:29.080
I-I'm getting out!

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.700
What's wrong, Hiiro?

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:43.830
Are you okay, weasel?

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:48.200
Retto? What's going on here?

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:52.540
Then he's the one who said those words?

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:55.160
They're at it again.

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:57.750
And now our next story.

00:09:57.750 --> 00:10:03.700
The first person has been arrested
under the new governor's law.

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:05.700
"EARTH DEFENSE FORCE
SAITAMA BRANCH"
Everyone, come here!

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:10.450
The charge is indecent exposure
in front of a minor.

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:12.410
The suspect is an employee
of Saitama City Hall

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:17.160
in a mysterious department
called Earth Defense Force.

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:19.330
I-It's not true, right?

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:21.500
I can't believe he's under arrest.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.870
I-It'll be all right, Retto!

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:27.120
Knowing your uncle,
it has to be some mistake!

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:29.250
But he's been charged.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:30.950
Sora!

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:32.660
Retto!

00:10:32.660 --> 00:10:34.120
From Anno.

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:36.790
He told me to give it to you
if anything happened.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:46.660
Now you can put on the XERO suit.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.250
XERO suit?

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:50.950
Turn your gear clockwise.

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:59.580
Th-This is...

00:10:59.580 --> 00:11:06.040
While you were all having fun,
Anno used my hair to make that.

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:08.500
What does it do?

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:11.910
It amplifies H-energy
and is resistant to it!

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:12.950
Then...

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:15.410
This way, your clothes
won't get ripped to shreds!

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:18.790
I appreciate that!

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:22.540
Even though we always get reimbursed,
it's a pain having to shop all the time.

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:28.120
Yeah. I find a pair of panties
that I like, but they get disintegrated!

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:29.750
It's terrible cost performance.

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:33.580
Maybe my uncle was arrested
because he made this.

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.410
Enjo.

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:41.700
Yes. Yes. Understood.

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:47.040
From headquarters?

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:49.450
Wh-What did they say?

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:53.540
Not even HQ knows the details.

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:58.750
And apparently we're in grave danger.

00:11:58.750 --> 00:12:00.580
What does that mean?

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:02.000
I don't know.

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:05.450
But it's possible
this dorm will be closed,

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:09.000
so we're all supposed to take our
XERO gear and go to our homes right away.

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:11.120
Th-Then...

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:15.000
For the time being,
HXEROS is disbanding.

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:24.040
Nyotaikachuu. How about I turn
your manhood into a weasel, too?

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:27.750
"ONE WEEK LATER"

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:34.450
Bro!

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:37.040
That's right. You're back home.

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:42.290
I can't believe
they banned you from the dorm.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:45.370
What did you do,
peek while the girls were taking a bath?

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:49.950
I can't even get a rise out of you?
Boring.

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:52.000
Go ahead and take your bath already.

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:56.200
It still doesn't feel real.

00:12:56.200 --> 00:13:02.250
Uncle's Our HXEROS has been disbanded?

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:12.950
Walking even when you're running late.
Now that's confidence.

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:15.540
Who are you to talk?

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:20.120
After what happened just a week ago...

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:22.330
I'm still in a daze.

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:26.910
On the bright side, we don't
have to help out with any heroics.

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:29.750
Shouldn't we try to see
the positive in this?

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:31.330
But still...

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:37.080
Besides, we're not in any club.

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:40.000
We have to try to enjoy
our high school life a little.

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.160
What does that mean?

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:43.120
So...

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:46.370
I'll hold on to this!

00:13:46.370 --> 00:13:52.290
When you're seriously enjoying
high school, I'll give it back to you.

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:54.660
Fireworks?

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:56.370
Is it that time of year already?

00:13:56.370 --> 00:13:59.700
Yeah. So I wanted to get your advice.

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:06.450
I see. You want to invite Enjo's friend
to the fireworks,

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:11.000
so I should ask Enjo to go,
and he'll in turn invite his friend.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:14.250
But I can't believe
you have a crush on Date.

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:15.540
Shh!

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:17.080
What's wrong with that?

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:22.450
Lately you've been chummy with Enjo,
so when I see that...

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:25.410
All right, fine.

00:14:25.410 --> 00:14:27.540
But you owe me one.

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:29.910
Thank you, Kirara!

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:31.080
This! This is it!

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:32.870
It's finally come!

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:40.830
A high school life that has nothing to do
with HXEROS or Kiseichuu or H-energy!

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:47.000
So keep this weekend open.

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:48.580
H-Hey, Hoshino...

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:51.500
...are you forcing yourself to invite me?

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:54.000
I-I'm not forcing myself!

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:57.790
So do you want to go or not?

00:14:57.790 --> 00:14:59.660
I want to go.

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:05.540
"FRANKFURTERS"
You're late, Kirara!

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:06.580
"FRANKFURTERS"
Sorry about that!

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:09.700
Thanks for waiting!

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:11.330
Yo!

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:14.040
You're wearing a yukata, too!

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:14.870
Huh?

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:17.120
Date, where's Enjo?

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:18.620
Oh, him?

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:22.620
I guess he got called in to work,
so he said he'll be a little late.

00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:24.000
Work?

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:26.000
"CANDIED APRICOTS"

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:28.660
Thanks. Well, give it a shot.

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:30.250
Leave it to me.

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:34.580
Too bad. Just one.

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.290
Hmph! You've got too much bad luck!

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:39.040
Why didn't you let me do it?

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:41.250
--I thought I'd win.
--You weren't even close.

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:44.830
Hey, Kirara, did something happen
between them?

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:45.870
I don't know.

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:49.290
But my guess is that things
happened behind our backs.

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:53.450
Still, after all their fighting,
those two...

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:54.950
What about you?

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:57.160
All of a sudden,
you and Enjo are on good terms.

00:15:57.160 --> 00:16:00.120
W-Well, I've known him for years.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:05.950
That said, the fireworks will start soon,
so where the heck is he?

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:09.620
I'm going to the restroom.

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:11.080
Okay.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.500
Sorry I'm late.

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:20.080
It's okay. I just got here myself.

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:24.370
That masked guy, for a second,
he looked like a Kiseichuu.

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:27.370
Obviously occupational disease.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:29.410
Ack!

00:16:29.410 --> 00:16:31.580
Look at that line!

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:34.370
I-I don't have a choice.

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:43.830
I'm sorry, God.

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:47.120
Enjo?

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:48.450
Hoshino?

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:52.120
Are you okay?
I mean, what are you doing here?

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:55.910
Well, on the way, I found a Kiseichuu.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:59.080
I tried to defeat it,
and this is the result.

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:04.410
Jeez, couldn't you contain for yourself
for just the night of the fireworks?

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:07.700
What the heck?
I, for one, was looking forward to it.

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:09.540
Sorry.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:13.750
I forgot that I didn't have my XERO gear.
I shouldn't have intervened.

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:16.450
I'm sorry. That's my fault!

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:18.830
No, it isn't.

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:22.870
But a lot of people
have gathered for the fireworks.

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:25.540
We can't turn a blind eye to a Kiseichuu
on a night like this, can we?

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:31.120
Hoshino, do you know
where they're setting off the fireworks?

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:33.870
I think it's over there.

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:35.080
I see.

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:38.620
Hey! What's happening?

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:42.540
It's going to attack here.

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:55.330
It's okay. Their H-energy was siphoned,
so they just fainted.

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:57.200
Enjo! Over there!

00:17:58.790 --> 00:18:04.700
From what I've heard,
just by launching this lump of gunpowder,

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:07.620
many humans pair up.

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:09.750
D-Don't do this!

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:13.830
A lot of people here have been looking
forward to this night for a long time!

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:18.200
Humans are foolish creatures
that get swept up by temporary emotions!

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:23.000
They deserve to be blown up
along with the gunpowder!

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:26.290
That's why I'm going to use
all of this gunpowder

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:29.160
in a place where humans congregate!

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:31.450
--Wait!
--I have to do something!

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:34.580
If you go over there,
she'll just wipe the floor with you again!

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:38.290
And HQ has prohibited us
from any HERO activities!

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:42.620
I didn't tell you yet, Hoshino?

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:46.410
How I first started
hunting the Kiseichuu.

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:51.540
At first, it was about revenge
for how they traumatized you.

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:55.950
That's why I agreed
to help my uncle with HXEROS.

00:18:55.950 --> 00:18:57.540
Enjo.

00:18:57.540 --> 00:19:01.200
But while being a member of HXEROS,
I realized something.

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:05.870
That we were protecting
people's romances.

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:09.750
If I can't protect
other people's romances,

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:12.410
how can I protect my own?

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:16.870
Come out, Dark Kirara.

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:23.910
What is it?
It's unusual for you to call on me.

00:19:23.910 --> 00:19:28.910
I need you to help me
raise H-energy right now.

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:31.500
That's an easy one!

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:33.700
Let me borrow your body for a minute.

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:42.540
Hey, Ret, look at me a second.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:55.620
U-Um, that was, uh...

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:05.160
H-Hoshino?

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:09.540
First, I'm gonna...

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:13.870
...kick her ass!

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:19.580
It's starting!

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:22.250
Wow!

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:25.290
I just hope
Kirara is watching it somewhere.

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:34.540
Don't stare at me.

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:36.290
It's embarrassing.

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:37.750
S-Sorry!

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:43.410
I was going to give it back to you.

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:45.540
Good thing I had it on me.

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:50.290
Hey!

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:53.040
Oh, you're all here, too?

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:56.290
Yeah. We ran into each other over there.

00:20:56.290 --> 00:21:00.700
We were tracking down
the Kiseichuu's signal and met up.

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:04.200
But it looks like you already
exterminated her, saving us the trouble.

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:08.750
H-Have you all
still been doing the HERO thing, too?

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:14.700
What? Did you think we were all
doing the gig reluctantly like you?

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:19.580
We weren't gonna quit HXEROS
over something like this.

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:22.160
Even Hime was hesitant in the beginning,

00:21:22.160 --> 00:21:25.120
but now it's like her eyes
have been opened, and she loves it.

00:21:25.120 --> 00:21:28.790
Hey, don't put it like that!
She'll get the wrong idea!

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:39.700
"MOGANA"
Still, I can't believe Enjo's uncle
fell afoul of the new governor's law.

00:21:40.870 --> 00:21:42.370
That human...

00:21:42.370 --> 00:21:44.910
What is it, Chacha?

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:49.080
Something about that human bothers me.

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:51.200
What bothers you?

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:55.750
I don't know,
but she seems familiar somehow.

00:21:55.750 --> 00:22:01.290
Could it be a plot with a camouflaged
Kiseichuu getting elected as governor,

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:05.040
who then had my uncle arrested
and HXEROS disbanded?

00:22:05.040 --> 00:22:07.580
Wh-What are you talking about, Retto?

00:22:07.580 --> 00:22:10.200
No, it's possible.

00:22:10.200 --> 00:22:13.580
There's only one way
to find out for sure.

00:22:13.580 --> 00:22:15.660
We have to meet this person.

00:23:48.040 --> 00:23:49.620
Super HXEROS!

00:23:49.620 --> 00:23:51.950
Next time: HXEROS Showdown!
